= Identities

$ sum_(i=1)^n i = (n(n+1))/2 $

$ sum_(i=1)^n i^2 = (n(n+1)(2n+1))/6 $

$ sum_(i=1)^n i^3 = (n^2(n+1)^2)/4 = (sum_(i=1)^n i)^2 $

== Geometric sequence

$ a, a r, a r^2, a r^3, dots, a r^(n-1) $ <eq:geometric-sequence-definition>

$r$ should not be $0$

=== Sum of the first $N$ terms

$ sum_(k=0)^(n-1) a r^k = a (1 - r^n)/(1-r) $ <eq:sum-first-n-terms-geometric>
